"вкладку «Карта введення»:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.rst:167
msgid ""
"A new Godot project includes a number of default actions already defined. To "
"see them, turn on :button:`Show Built-in Actions` in the InputMap dialog."
msgstr ""
