#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:165
msgid "in vec3 **POSITION**"
msgstr "In vec3 **POSITION**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:165
